{"lines": ["How is Christopher Columbus connected to Baby Yoda?", "In eighteen forty-three, an American artist painted Columbus pleading with Queen Isabella of Spain to fund his voyage.", "Isabella's crown passed down five centuries of Spanish monarchs to King Juan Carlos in nineteen seventy-five.", "In nineteen eighty-one, Ronald Reagan welcomed King Juan Carlos to the White House for a state dinner.", "In nineteen eighty-five, Reagan hosted Alien star Sigourney Weaver at another White House state dinner.", "In twenty twenty-six, Weaver joined director Jon Favreau in Paris to present The Mandalorian and Grogu.", "Favreau created Grogu, the puppet fans call Baby Yoda, for The Mandalorian in twenty nineteen.", "How is Mao Zedong connected to Shrek?", "In nineteen seventy-five, Mao Zedong shook hands with Henry Kissinger in Beijing, as President Gerald Ford looked on.", "In two thousand nine, Kissinger came to the Oval Office to advise President Barack Obama on nuclear weapons.", "In twenty twelve, Mike Myers performed for Obama at a White House concert honoring Burt Bacharach.", "And since two thousand one, Mike Myers has been the voice of Shrek.", "How is Zeus connected to The Rock?", "Rubens painted Zeus, whom the Romans called Jupiter, watching over France's King Henry the Fourth.", "Henry's throne passed through Louis the Fourteenth, Napoleon and de Gaulle, down to President Emmanuel Macron.", "In twenty eighteen, Macron visited Vladimir Putin in Saint Petersburg.", "In twenty thirteen, Putin shook hands with Barack Obama at the G8 summit in Northern Ireland.", "In twenty fifteen, Obama went to the Pentagon with his Defense Secretary, Ash Carter, to plan the fight against ISIS.", "A year later, Carter met comedian Kevin Hart backstage at Late Night with Seth Meyers.", "And in Berlin in twenty sixteen, Hart posed with his Central Intelligence co-star, The Rock.", "How is Vladimir Lenin connected to the Minions?", "Lenin founded the Soviet state in nineteen seventeen, and the line of Kremlin leaders runs to Vladimir Putin.", "In twenty fifteen, Putin met President Barack Obama at the United Nations in New York.", "That December, Jerry Seinfeld knocked on Obama's Oval Office window to film Comedians in Cars Getting Coffee.", "In twenty seventeen, Seinfeld shared a Montreal stage with his friend, French comedian Gad Elmaleh.", "And Elmaleh, the French voice of Gru, posed with the Minions at their twenty twenty-two Paris premiere.", "How is Diddy connected to George Washington?", "In nineteen ninety-eight, Diddy and Donald Trump posed together at a celebrity polo match in the Hamptons.", "In November twenty sixteen, the newly elected Trump met outgoing President Barack Obama in the Oval Office.", "Obama was the 44th president, and that line of presidents runs all the way back to the first, George Washington."], "heard": [["How", 0.0, 0.32], ["is", 0.32, 0.44], ["Christopher", 0.44, 0.74], ["Columbus", 0.74, 1.18], ["connected", 1.18, 1.64], ["to", 1.64, 1.92], ["Baby", 1.92, 2.14], ["Yoda?", 2.14, 2.6], ["In", 3.42, 3.48], ["1843,", 3.48, 3.98], ["an", 4.4, 4.5], ["American", 4.5, 4.76], ["artist", 4.76, 5.14], ["painted", 5.14, 5.44], ["Columbus,", 5.44, 5.96], ["pleading", 6.28, 6.4], ["with", 6.4, 6.62], ["Queen", 6.62, 6.82], ["Isabella", 6.82, 7.28], ["of", 7.28, 7.56], ["Spain", 7.56, 7.82], ["to", 7.82, 8.02], ["fund", 8.02, 8.24], ["his", 8.24, 8.4], ["voyage.", 8.4, 8.6], ["Isabella's", 9.26, 9.6], ["crown", 9.6, 9.82], ["passed", 9.82, 10.12], ["down", 10.12, 10.4], ["five", 10.4, 10.66], ["centuries", 10.66, 11.1], ["of", 11.1, 11.36], ["Spanish", 11.36, 11.58], ["monarchs", 11.58, 12.22], ["to", 12.22, 12.34], ["King", 12.34, 12.48], ["Juan", 12.48, 12.72], ["Carlos", 12.72, 13.08], ["in", 13.08, 13.34], ["1975.", 13.34, 13.84], ["In", 14.7, 14.82], ["1981,", 14.82, 15.18], ["Ronald", 15.86, 16.08], ["Reagan", 16.08, 16.36], ["welcomed", 16.36, 16.66], ["King", 16.66, 17.02], ["Juan", 17.02, 17.26], ["Carlos", 17.26,